  "name": "Templar: Sacred Swing is single-use after avoiding an attack (#8357)",
  "contract": [
    "Rank-5 Sacred Swing 572769 reads 'Only usable after avoiding an attack.' Its Spell.dbc CasterAuraSpell is",
    "681170 Recently Parried or Dodged (8 s dummy aura), granted by Keeping the Oath 92109 on dodge/parry and",
    "never consumed by the cast, so one avoidance enabled repeated casts within the 8 s window. Expected: casting",
    "Sacred Swing consumes 681170, so a second cast without a new avoidance is refused. QA Test 100% Dodge 10020",
    "makes every swing a dodge; the attacker's hit rating removes misses. Threat (spell_threat 2.25x) has no",
    "harness metric and is covered by data review plus in-game testing."
